ent-CMUActionReportInfantry = Report infantry
    .desc = Mark observed infantry on your faction's tactical map. Reports expire automatically and do not follow targets.
ent-CMUActionReportVehicle = Report vehicle
    .desc = Mark an observed vehicle on your faction's tactical map. Reports expire automatically and do not follow targets.
ent-CMUActionReportEmplacement = Report emplacement
    .desc = Mark an observed emplacement on your faction's tactical map. Reports expire automatically and do not follow targets.
ent-CMUActionReportUnknown = Report unknown contact
    .desc = Mark an unidentified contact on your faction's tactical map. Reports expire automatically and do not follow targets.
cmu-scout-report-action-description = Mark an observed contact on your faction's tactical map. Reports last {$lifetime} seconds and do not follow targets. You can report every {$cooldown} seconds; exceeding {$limit} active reports replaces your oldest. Maximum reporting range: {$range} tiles, within sight of your optics.
cmu-scout-contact-infantry = Infantry
cmu-scout-contact-vehicle = Vehicle
cmu-scout-contact-emplacement = Emplacement
cmu-scout-contact-unknown = Unknown
cmu-scout-report-label = Report: {$type} - {$reporter} - {$age}s ago
cmu-scout-report-untrained = You lack the scout or spotter training required to report with these optics.
cmu-scout-report-not-scoped = Look through your scout binoculars or spotter scope before reporting.
cmu-scout-report-no-faction = You have no faction tactical channel to report to.
cmu-scout-report-invalid-position = That location cannot be marked on the tactical map.
cmu-scout-report-cooldown = Wait {$cooldown} seconds between contact reports, even when changing optics or contact type.
cmu-scout-report-not-visible = You must be able to see the reported location through your optics.
cmu-scout-report-sent = Contact report shared on your faction's tactical map.
cmu-scout-report-radio = All stations, this is {$callsign}. Contact report: {$contact} observed at grid {$x}, {$y}, {$area}. Time now. Position marked on tactical map. Over.
cmu-scout-report-unknown-area = unknown area
cmu-scout-report-no-callsign = Report mapped, but radio transmission requires an assigned faction callsign.
cmu-scout-report-no-radio-channel = Report mapped, but your faction has no configured reporting radio channel.
